#VRML_SIM R2023b utf8
# road_loop: a 366 m rounded-square loop of 7 m road with 0.15 m curbs (60 m
# straights, 20 m-radius corners), car spawned at (0, -50) heading +x.
# Generated by road_follower's tools/make_world.py (2026-10-10); sensors moved
# to the real cart mount (1.52 m, 9 deg down) as in tesla_city.wbt. Narrow
# enough that both road edges are in view, unlike tesla_city's 21.5 m roads.

